This product includes software from these projects, all licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler (https://github.com/numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler), commit 4490bd1:
  the pipeline code in seedvr2_vendor/ (upstream folder name: src/), the root __init__.py, configs_3b/, configs_7b/,
  pos_emb.pt and neg_emb.pt.
- SeedVR / SeedVR2 (https://github.com/ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR), Copyright (c) 2025 Bytedance Ltd. and/or its affiliates:
  the model code that the files above are based on.
