Changes to the files above made in this project:
- the src/ folder is renamed to seedvr2_vendor/, so it cannot clash with another extension's package named src;
- the files changed in this project carry a "Local patch (Forge Neo)" comment at each change;
- requirements.txt lists only the packages the code uses.
The full list is in docs/external-apis/seedvr2-upstream.md ("Local patches").

The Forge extension is based on the original SeedVR2 extension for Forge by akoyaki ayagi.
